.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-task-read 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-task\-read \- One field of one task\*(Aqs record, so a prober composes rather than parsing the layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten task read\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIpid\fR> <\fIfield\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
One field of one task\*(Aqs record, so a prober composes rather than parsing the layout
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIpid\fR>
The process the record is keyed by
.TP
<\fIfield\fR>
The record field to print
